## 6. Per-Org Verdict Table

Table columns: Org | Repos now | Canonical target | State | Verdict
- @openOODA (meta) | 6 (+`8`, +debris) | 5–6 | `status` undocumented; `catalog` carries `caps`/`echo`/`hello` non-oo fixture
  packages | KEEP all; document `status`; sweep debris
- core (L0) | 9 | 9 (docs: 10–11) | Cleanest org; names honest (`oodac`/`oodar`/`cli`/`ooda`/`opm`/`lsp`/`mcp`/`std`/`tui`) |
  KEEP
- kernel (L1) | 16 | 6 | Names=dirs fine; absorptions are ad-hoc pairwise (net⊃pci+usb-hid; sched⊃mm+ipc; pci⊃virtio;
  boot⊃unikernel; mm⊃iommu), none of RFC's `ooboot`/`oohal`/`oodrv-*` names exist | **SPLIT/RENAME per RFC**; un-nest the
  pairwise absorbs
- OS (L2) | 18 | 8 | Real subtree absorbs done (init⊃{healthd,svcmgr}, vfs⊃{ext4,tmp}, netd⊃dns, session⊃policy, devd⊃power);
  stragglers: `ooaudiod`, `oologd`, `oorealm`, `oosysbus`(host), `oohealthd` dual-exists; `ooauthd` ghost | Mostly on-track;
  dedupe `oohealthd`; decide `ooauthd` rename; home `ooaudiod`/`oologd`/`oorealm` (→`oosysbus`/`oohealthd`/`ooimage`?)
- tools (L3) | 258 | 64 | 104 shipped + 104 skeleton stubs + ~50 partial; name zoo is worst in ecosystem (see §3.3–4.4);
  `oocurl` is the model consolidator (real `persona/` impl) | Aggressive merge per RFC persona tables; fix `oosqllite`/`oote`
  /dup families; stubs stay backlog, not "archive"
- DE (L4) | 20 | 9 | Canonical-9 confirmed in code; hosts carry persona subtrees; 3 dup embeddings (ooclip/ooshot/ootaskmgr);
  `oocockpit` nests canonical `ooagent-hud` | KEEP 9; dedupe; disassemble `oocockpit`
- apps (L5) | 17 | 11 | oomedia✓clean; `ooflash` real but unlisted; `oodocs`=de-facto `oooffice`; `oomail`/`oochat` inverted;
  `oonotes`/`oopdf` dual-exist | RENAME `oodocs`→`oooffice`; pick mail/chat direction; archive marked repos after verdicts
- cloud (L6) | 18 | 8 | All 8 canonical exist + all absorbs embedded; BUT `oodns-cloud` & `ooqueue` dup'd, `oobuild-fleet`⊃
  `oodeploy` reverse-embed; `link-law` gate absent everywhere | KEEP 8; dedupe oodns-cloud→oomesh, ooqueue→oodb-dist; strip
  `oodeploy/` from `oobuild-fleet`; add gates
- agents (L7) | 16 | 8 | Absorbs embedded; `oocoder` inverted into `ooreviewer`; `ooarchitect` dup'd (oogovern + oooda-engine);
  `oorouter`/`ooherdr` unmerged overlap; `oogovern`/`ooarchitect`/`oorelease` triple-overlap; RFC typo `oofalse` | KEEP 8;
  un-invert `oocoder`; fold `oorouter`→`ooherdr`; fix RFC typo; add gates

